# Universal Coding Standards & AI Agent Guidance
# Comprehensive rules for web application projects — read fully before generating or editing code.
#
# This file contains universal coding standards, patterns, and best practices
# to be applied across all projects in this workspace.

---

## 0. Priority Order (Nguyên tắc ưu tiên)

> **Security > Privacy > UX > Performance**

---

## 1. Tech Stack & Conventions

### Core Technologies (có thể áp dụng cho mỗi dự án)
- **Frontend:** Next.js 14 (App Router), React, TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, CSS Modules
- **Animation:** GSAP (complex sequences, scroll-driven)
- **Backend:** Node.js, Server Actions, REST/GraphQL APIs
- **Database:** PostgreSQL, Supabase, Prisma
- **Testing:** Vitest (unit), Playwright (E2E)
- **CI/CD:** GitHub Actions, Vercel, Docker

### Naming Convention
- **Component:** PascalCase (`BreathingOrb` không phải `breathing-orb`)
- **File:** kebab-case hoặc PascalCase — đồng nhất trong cùng thư mục
- **Function/hook:** camelCase (`useGSAP`, `validateInput`)

---

## 2. Project Structure (Directory Convention)

```
src/
+-- app/         # Next.js App Router (route groups)
+-- components/  # UI tách theo nhóm (ui/, layout/, shared/)
+-- constants/   # Hằng số: routes, colors, validation
+-- hooks/       # Custom hooks
+-- lib/         # Services, utilities
+-- schemas/     # Zod validation schemas
+-- types/       # TypeScript types
```

### Server vs Client Components
- Dùng `'use client'` ở đầu file **chỉ** khi cần hooks/state interactivity
- Server Actions (`async function`): đặt trong cùng file component, export dùng `<form action={...}>`
- Middleware: giữ mỗi request — xử lý auth session refresh + route protection

### Route Protection Pattern
| Loại route | Hành động |
|---|---|
| Auth routes (login, register) | Redirect to dashboard nếu đã auth |
| Protected routes | Redirect to login nếu chưa auth |
| Public routes | Truy cập tự do |

