## 10. Animation Standards

> **BẮT BUỘC:** Trước khi viết bất kỳ animation code nào, đọc file `skills-animation.md` để chọn library và pattern phù hợp.

### 10.1 Animation Library Selection

| Library | Use Case | Install |
|---|---|---|
| **GSAP** | Complex timelines, scroll-driven, SVG morphing | `npm i gsap` |
| **CSS Transitions** | Interactive state changes (hover, toggle) | built-in |
| **CSS Keyframes** | One-shot enter animations, loading | built-in |
| **Framer Motion** | Declarative React animations, layout, gestures | `npm i framer-motion` |
| **React Spring** | Physics-based animations, gesture-driven | `npm i @react-spring/web` |
| **Anime.js** | Lightweight vanilla JS, SVG paths | `npm i animejs` |

### 10.2 Core Rules

1. **Đọc `skills-animation.md`** trước khi viết animation code
2. **Animate GPU-accelerated properties only:** `transform` (x, y, scale, rotation) và `opacity`
3. **Tránh layout-triggering properties:** `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`
4. **Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`** — wrap trong `gsap.matchMedia()` hoặc CSS media query
5. **Interruptible animations** cho interactive elements (CSS transitions > keyframes)
6. **Motion restraint** — motion is a budget, not a garnish

### 10.3 Quick Reference

| Scenario | Recommended |
|---|---|
| Button hover/toggle | CSS transition |
| Page hero entrance | GSAP from() or Motion variants |
| Scroll-driven reveal | GSAP ScrollTrigger |
| Complex sequencing | GSAP Timeline |
| Staggered list | GSAP stagger or Motion staggerChildren |
| Layout expand/collapse | Framer Motion `layout` |
| SVG path morphing | GSAP or Anime.js |
| Icon swap (toggle) | AnimatePresence with `initial={false}` |

---

## 11. GSAP Animation Rules

> Nguồn: `.agents/skills/gsap-*/SKILL.md`

### 11.1 GSAP Core

#### Core Tween Methods
- `gsap.to(targets, vars)` — animate từ current state đến `vars`
- `gsap.from(targets, vars)` — animate từ `vars` đến current state
- `gsap.fromTo(targets, fromVars, toVars)` — explicit start/end
- `gsap.set(targets, vars)` — apply immediately (duration 0)
- Dùng **camelCase** cho property names (`backgroundColor`, `rotationX`)

#### Easing
```js
ease: "power1.out"   // default
ease: "power3.inOut"
ease: "back.out(1.7)"
ease: "elastic.out(1, 0.3)"
ease: "none"         // linear
```

#### Transform aliases (PREFER over raw transform string)
| GSAP | CSS equivalent |
|---|---|
| `x`, `y`, `z` | translateX/Y/Z (px) |
| `xPercent`, `yPercent` | % |
| `scale`, `scaleX`, `scaleY` | scale |
| `rotation` | rotate (deg) |
| `rotationX`, `rotationY` | 3D rotate |
| `skewX`, `skewY` | skew |
| `transformOrigin` | transform-origin |

- **autoAlpha** — prefer over `opacity`. Khi 0, set `visibility: hidden`

### 11.2 GSAP React

#### useGSAP() Hook (PREFER over useEffect)
```js
import { useGSAP } from "@gsap/react";
gsap.registerPlugin(useGSAP); // register before running

const containerRef = useRef(null);
useGSAP(() => {
  gsap.to(".box", { x: 100 });
  gsap.from(".item", { opacity: 0, stagger: 0.1 });
}, { scope: containerRef });
```

#### Best practices
- ✅ Dùng **useGSAP()** thay vì `useEffect()`/`useLayoutEffect()`
- ✅ Pass **scope** (ref/element) để selectors được giới hạn
- ✅ Cleanup (reverting) chạy tự động trên unmount
- ✅ Dùng **contextSafe** để wrap callbacks

### 11.3 GSAP Timeline

#### Tạo timeline
```js
const tl = gsap.timeline();
tl.to(".a", { x: 100, duration: 1 })
  .to(".b", { y: 50, duration: 0.5 })
  .to(".c", { opacity: 0, duration: 0.3 });
```

#### Position parameter (3rd argument)
- **Absolute:** `1` — start at 1s
- **Relative:** `"+=0.5"` — 0.5s sau end; `"-=0.2"` — 0.2s trước end
- **Label:** `"labelName"` — tại label; `"labelName+=0.3"` — 0.3s sau label
- **Placement:** `"<"` — start cùng tween trước; `">"` — start khi tween trước end (default)

### 11.4 GSAP ScrollTrigger

#### Register plugin (once)
```js
gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
```

#### Basic trigger
```js
gsap.to(".box", {
  x: 500, duration: 1,
  scrollTrigger: {
    trigger: ".box",
    start: "top center",
    end: "bottom center",
    toggleActions: "play reverse play reverse"
  }
});
```

#### Key config options
| Property | Mô tả |
|---|---|
| `trigger` | Element định nghĩa vị trí start (required) |
| `start` | Khi trigger active. Default `"top bottom"` |
| `end` | Khi trigger kết thúc. Default `"bottom top"` |
| `scrub` | `true` = direct link; number = seconds để "catch up" |
| `toggleActions` | Thứ tự: onEnter, onLeave, onEnterBack, onLeaveBack |
| `pin` | `true` = pin trigger element |
| `markers` | `true` cho dev markers — **loại bỏ khi production** |

### 11.5 GSAP Performance

- ✅ Animate: **x, y, scale, rotation, opacity** (transform & opacity)
- ❌ Tránh: **width, height, top, left, margin, padding** (trigger layout)
- Dùng `will-change: transform` chỉ cho elements thực sự animate
- Dùng **stagger** thay vì nhiều separate tweens với manual delays
- Dùng `gsap.quickTo()` cho frequent updates (mouse followers)

### 11.6 GSAP Plugins

#### Register plugins (once)
```js
import gsap from "gsap";
import { ScrollToPlugin } from "gsap/ScrollToPlugin";
import { Flip } from "gsap/Flip";
import { Draggable } from "gsap/Draggable";
gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollToPlugin, Flip, Draggable);
```

### 11.7 GSAP Utils

- `clamp(min, max, value?)` — ràng buộc giá trị
- `mapRange(inMin, inMax, outMin, outMax, value?)` — map từ range sang range khác
- `normalize(min, max, value?)` — chuẩn hoá về 0–1
- `interpolate(start, end, progress?)` — nội suy giữa 2 giá trị
- `random(min, max, snap?)` — ngẫu nhiên trong range
- `snap(snapTo, value?)` — snap về step/labels
- `toArray(value, scope?)` — convert selector/NodeList/element thành array
- `wrap(min, max, value?)` — wrap value vào range

**Lưu ý:** GSAP CSSPlugin không parse được `var(--token)` trong chuỗi màu → resolve bằng `getComputedStyle(...)` rồi truyền `rgb()/rgba()/hex` cụ thể.

### 11.8 GSAP Frameworks (Vue, Svelte, Nuxt)

- Tạo tweens/ScrollTriggers **sau** khi DOM sẵn sàng (onMounted, onMount)
- Kill/revert chúng trong unmount cleanup
- Scope selectors tới component root
- `gsap.context()` + cleanup `ctx.revert()`

