## 12. Component System

| Component | Mô tả |
|---|---|
| Button | 6 variants, 4 sizes |
| Input / Textarea | Focus ring chuẩn |
| Card / InteractiveCard | Hover nâng nhẹ |
| Alert | destructive/success/info |
| Badge | 6 variants |
| Toast | tự ẩn 5s |

